{"v":[{"a":["ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنُ"],"t":"The Compassionate","l":"Ar-Rahmanu","w":[["al-raḥmānu","The Most Gracious"]]},{"a":["عَلَّمَ","ٱلۡقُرۡءَانَ"],"t":"Has taught the Quran","l":"Allama Al-Qur'ana","w":[["ʿallama","He taught"],["l-qur'āna","the Quran"]]},{"a":["خَلَقَ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ"],"t":"He created man","l":"Khalaqa Al-'Insana","w":[["khalaqa","He created"],["l-insāna","[the] man"]]},{"a":["عَلَّمَهُ","ٱلۡبَيَانَ"],"t":"And taught him clear expression","l":"Allamahu Al-Bayana","w":[["ʿallamahu","He taught him"],["l-bayāna","[the] speech"]]},{"a":["ٱلشَّمۡسُ","وَٱلۡقَمَرُ","بِحُسۡبَانٖ"],"t":"The sun and the moon move according to plan","l":"Ash-Shamsu Wa Al-Qamaru Bihusbanin","w":[["al-shamsu","The sun"],["wal-qamaru","and the moon"],["biḥus'bānin","by (precise) calculation"]]},{"a":["وَٱلنَّجۡمُ","وَٱلشَّجَرُ","يَسۡجُدَانِ"],"t":"And the stars and the trees prostrate themselves","l":"Wa An-Najmu Wa Ash-Shajaru Yasjudani","w":[["wal-najmu","And the stars"],["wal-shajaru","and the trees"],["yasjudāni","both prostrate"]]},{"a":["وَٱلسَّمَآءَ","رَفَعَهَا","وَوَضَعَ","ٱلۡمِيزَانَ"],"t":"And the sky, He raised; and He set up the balance","l":"Wa As-Sama'a Rafa`aha Wa Wađa`a Al-Mizana","w":[["wal-samāa","And the heaven"],["rafaʿahā","He raised it"],["wawaḍaʿa","and He has set up"],["l-mīzāna","the balance"]]},{"a":["أَلَّا","تَطۡغَوۡاْ","فِي","ٱلۡمِيزَانِ"],"t":"So do not transgress in the balance","l":"Alla Tatghaw Fi Al-Mizani","w":[["allā","That not"],["taṭghaw","you may transgress"],["fī","in"],["l-mīzāni","the balance"]]},{"a":["وَأَقِيمُواْ","ٱلۡوَزۡنَ","بِٱلۡقِسۡطِ","وَلَا","تُخۡسِرُواْ","ٱلۡمِيزَانَ"],"t":"But maintain the weights with justice, and do not violate the balance","l":"Wa 'Aqimu Al-Wazna Bil-Qisti Wa La Tukhsiru Al-Mizana","w":[["wa-aqīmū","And establish"],["l-wazna","the weight"],["bil-qis'ṭi","in justice"],["walā","and (do) not"],["tukh'sirū","make deficient"],["l-mīzāna","the balance"]]},{"a":["وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ","وَضَعَهَا","لِلۡأَنَامِ"],"t":"And the eart