d for Him"],["l-jawāri","(are) the ships"],["l-munshaātu","elevated"],["fī","in"],["l-baḥri","the sea"],["kal-aʿlāmi","like mountains"]]},{"a":["فَبِأَيِّ","ءَالَآءِ","رَبِّكُمَا","تُكَذِّبَانِ"],"t":"So which of your Lord’s marvels will you deny","l":"Fabi'ayyi 'Ala'i Rabbikuma Tukadhibani","w":[["fabi-ayyi","So which"],["ālāi","(of the) favors"],["rabbikumā","(of) your Lord"],["tukadhibāni","will you both deny"]]},{"a":["كُلُّ","مَنۡ","عَلَيۡهَا","فَانٖ"],"t":"Everyone upon it is perishing","l":"Kullu Man `Alayha Fanin","w":[["kullu","Everyone"],["man","who"],["ʿalayhā","(is) on it"],["fānin","(will) perish"]]},{"a":["وَيَبۡقَىٰ","وَجۡهُ","رَبِّكَ","ذُو","ٱلۡجَلَٰلِ","وَٱلۡإِكۡرَامِ"],"t":"But will remain the Presence of your Lord, Full of Majesty and Splendor","l":"Wa Yabqa Wajhu Rabbika Dhu Al-Jalali Wa Al-'Ikrami","w":[["wayabqā","But will remain"],["wajhu","(the) Face"],["rabbika","(of) your Lord"],["dhū","(the) Owner"],["l-jalāli","(of) Majesty"],["wal-ik'rāmi","and Honor"]]},{"a":["فَبِأَيِّ","ءَالَآءِ","رَبِّكُمَا","تُكَذِّبَانِ"],"t":"So which of your Lord’s marvels will you deny","l":"Fabi'ayyi 'Ala'i Rabbikuma Tukadhibani","w":[["fabi-ayyi","So which"],["ālāi","(of the) favors"],["rabbikumā","(of) your Lord"],["tukadhibāni","will you both deny"]]},{"a":["يَسۡـَٔلُهُۥ","مَن","فِي","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلۡأَرۡضِۚ","كُلَّ","يَوۡمٍ","هُوَ","فِي","شَأۡنٖ"],"t":"Everyone in the heavens and the earth asks Him. Every day He is managing","l":"Yas'aluhu Man Fi As-Samawati Wa Al-'Arđi Kulla Yawmin Huwa Fi Sha'nin","w":[["yasaluhu","Asks Him"],["man","whoever"],["fī","(is) in"],["l-samāwāti","the heavens"],["wal-arḍi","and the earth"],["kulla","Every"],["yawmin","day"],["huwa","He"],["fī","(is) in"],["shanin","a matter"]]},{"a":["فَبِأَيِّ","ءَالَآءِ","رَبِّكُمَا","تُكَذِّبَانِ"],"t":"So which of your Lord’s marvels will you deny","l":"Fabi'ayyi 'Ala'i Rabbikuma Tukadhibani","w":[["fabi-ayyi","So which"],["ālāi","(of the) favors"],["rabbikumā","(of) your Lord"],["t